{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id751245057"}, "name":{"label":"chhhiiii"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-25T10:09:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.94.0"}, "id":{"label":"10863197967"}, "title":{"label":"Service too bad"}, "content":{"label":"I sent request for a name modification a month before deparment, now its been 6 days and everyday a new staff sent me a brand new email that didn't solve my problem at all. They said that they needed to place a new flight for me and asked me when my freetime is so that they could send the link to new flight booking (I CANT BOOK DIRECTLY AND ALSO NO REFUND), i said i was free at that time and they told me to wait for 30 minutes, and disappeared! I mailed them again and the only answer i received was \"wait for 12hours\" \"wait for 24hours\" \"wait for 3 working days\" !!!???? And the other booking that I also sent name modification request, they sent me a fee on the app as \"change name fee\" but after I paid, the next day, they sent me an email to tell me that I will have to place a new booking through them???? So what is the fee for? I thought that after paying the fee everything is done but NO :) I DON'T EVEN KNOW WHAT TO DO NOW! I spent 30mins speaking on phone call with a staff to solve the problem, and the next day, another staff just sent me email like nothing happened? And I had to explain again that yesterday a staff already said that to me? Like don't they have a note to update the staff on next shift?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=681752345&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"8"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"15"}}, 
